  english:
    title: D Type Fire Estinguisher
    message: D-type fire extinguishers are used for fires involving combustible metals
      such as magnesium and aluminum. Water must not be used in these fires. Special
      extinguishing powders should be applied.
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 07fac9ff56d5ce842bbe663c6e8ea073, type: 2}
  turkish:
    title: "D Tipi Yang\u0131n T\xFCp\xFC"
    message: "D tipi yang\u0131n t\xFCpleri, yan\u0131c\u0131 metallerin olu\u015Fturdu\u011Fu
      yang\u0131nlar i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Magnezyum ve al\xFCminyum gibi
      metallerde etkilidir. Bu yang\u0131nlarda su kullan\u0131lmamal\u0131, \xF6zel
      s\xF6nd\xFCrme tozu ile m\xFCdahale edilmelidir."
    sound: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 924b4dc98bc9de2429353a17a6cc83a9, type: 2}
